= Functional programming, design and analysis of algorithms examination paper by the University of Oxford (2014)
{parent=Computer science bibliography}

https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/past_exam_papers_for_1st_year_of/response/1398416/attach/2/Fakour%20Zip%20Final%201.zip?cookie_passthrough=1[Released examination archive], member `4208.pdf`. The original eight-page paper identifies the preliminary examination held on 17 June 2014. Questions 1–4 concern <functional programming> and Questions 5–8 concern <analysis of algorithms>. Question 5(b) permits signed <integers> but prints a bound containing $\log_2 m$; for nonpositive inputs the meaningful extension uses $\log_2\max(2,|m|)$.

