{parent=Computer science bibliography}
{c}
{title2=October 1989}

https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1122.html

Section 4.2.2.17 explains why <TCP> must recover from a lost window-reopening <acknowledgement>. Section 4.2.3.4 discusses <Nagle's algorithm>.

